OL,3,GNEWSALandslip repair funding decision
OL,4,Ais 'imminent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, following a meeting of the
OL,7,Fgrowth, environment and transport
OL,8,Fcabinet committee on Tuesday, Labour MP
OL,9,FJim Dickson said the council seemed to
OL,10,Fbe "anticipating good news" regarding
OL,11,Fthe outcome.
